00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.100
Besides, if I clean off all the dust...

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.900
What the heck, this stain here isn't coming off at all

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.300
theres no stain there it looks clean

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:17.900
This

