Where?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.100
Here

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.700
There's nothing there.
Where are you talking about?

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.300
Right here, Geez!

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:27.500
Can you see the stain?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.800
Thats what I've been saying this whole ti...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.700
Can you here my voice?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.800
You can hear my voice, can't you

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.400
Well I dont see any kind of stain th...

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:41.600
Who's there?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.300
Stop it! Hikaru. dont say weird things like that

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.100
I found Him... I finally found him

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.400
Is that Jii-chan? Come on out

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.400
I'm leaving

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.500
God... I thank you…

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.500
I will

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:04.300
I will

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.900
I will once again return to the

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.400
To the mortal realm

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.500
What happened... Hikaru

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.100
Hikaru... Oji-San Hikaru needs help

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.800
Who are you

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.500
Fujiwara Sai

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:35.900
Sai

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.200
What kinda person are you?

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:41.500
I was a GO instructor for the emperor of the Hiean era in the Capital...

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.000
Every single day.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.700
I was happy. Being able to play Go

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:56.500
However, there was another person that also served as the emperors Go instructor.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.400
One day. He suggested to the Emperor that

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.600
"There is only need for one Go instructor"

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.700
Let us play a game to decide who is superior.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.600
and let the victor stay and serve you

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:07.900
And?

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:09.700
You played each other?

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:11.500
Who won?

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.500
The game went on with both of us at about the even score

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.100
The fact that only I saw the event,

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:21.200
While everyone looked on, was purely coincidental

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:25.100
A single stone had somehow mixed into his Goke

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.700
And, when he saw a instant of opportunity,

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.500
he added it to his Agehime

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.300
He Cheated

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.700
Just as I spoke out...

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.100
Just now, you…

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.600
Hey! you!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.100
You just added a black stone that was inside your Goke into your Agehime!

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.500
What are you saying?

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.100
Thats exactly what you did!

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.800
What a pathetic excuse.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:56.000
You took advantage of the fact that everyone was focused on the Game

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.900
And added that stone into your Agehime!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:01.900
Stop Lying!

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:03.700
Quiet. Stop acting like fools.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.800
I dont even want to think such a backhanded action was performed in front of me

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.700
Continue playing

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.800
I lost...

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.600
Because I was unable to calm myself down after the commotion

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.100
I was driven out of the capital.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.700
My name was tainted with the allegations that I had cheated in the game

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.000
There was no way for me to continue living.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.000
2 days later

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.900
I drowned myself

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:48.600
Of course,

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.700
I still wanted to play more Go…

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.800
My soul, which still could not head for the Jobutsu

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.700
Time Passed

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.100
And at Inno Island, One of the Islands residing on the Seto Seas

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.400
I heard the voice of a young boy

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.600
His name was Torajirou

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:08.900
Child...

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.600
If you can see those tears of spite shed

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:17.300
Please let me dwell in a corner of your heart

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.800
Torajirou's name was changed to Shuusaku.

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.900
He became the heir for his master

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:28.700
At the age of 20, and became the fourteenth-generation Hon-Inbo Shuusaku

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.200
Hon-Inbo Shuusaku?

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.600
However Torajirou fell prey to a disease epidemic

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:39.000
One night…at the age of 34, he…

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:44.400
So it was his blood that was on the Go board, Huh

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.400
And, since you came to dwell in my mind

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.100
Does that mean you still want to play Go?

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:51.900
Yes

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.300
For...

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.200
I have not yet...

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.600
Achieved the hand of god!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.000
Hikaru

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.500
I heard you needed to be taken on an ambulance yesterday?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:19.100
Hikaru

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.800
Hikaru, are you really alright?

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.500
What happened yesterday?

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:30.700
