00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.200
Alright Please begin

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:45.200
History problems

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.000
You!!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:49.500
What is it?

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:54.100
Er, um, uh.. I'm sorry..

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.300
Sit down and continue the test

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.100
Yes

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.900
So that thing yesterday wasn't a dream?

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:01.400
Right

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.800
And? What was your name again?

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:04.700
I'm Sai

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:05.800
Sai Huh

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.900
Do you really like Go that much?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:08.500
Yes

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:09.700
Do you still want to play Go?

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:10.300
Yes

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.100
Well sorry...

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.500
I'm not interested in playing Go at all.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.200
Hikaru

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:21.300
Shindou-Kun?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.500
What the hell did you do, you bastard?

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:29.100
I...I didn't do a thing...nothing at all...

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.300
Hiakru, are you alright?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.200
Shindou-Kun?

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.100
Shindou-Kun, are you alright? Do you want to see the nurse?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.600
Eh I'm Fine now..

