The sadness I felt from not being able to play Go again

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.000
Filled your consiciousness.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:47.500
Heh your passion over a 1000 years time is damn impressive

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.700
But you know. I got my own plans for my life.

