Can't you just find someone else's mind to dwell in?

00:09:58.900 --> 00:09:59.700
Probably not

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.300
Fine

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.300
If it's just playing every once and awhile then its alright

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.800
