00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:25.000
All the while I hold in one hand
kokoro yurashinagara
心揺らしながら

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:29.500
the  dazzeling thing I'd lost
massniro no chizu katate ni mochinagara
真っ白な地図を片手に持ちながら

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.300
Even though the wind blows
Kaze ni fukeranagara
風に吹かれながら

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.450
Even though I'm going slow
